  "id": "secondary-attention",
  "term": "secondary attention",
  "definition": "Secondary attention refers to attentional resources used for a second task at the same time as a primary activity. In this context, it means the attention needed for a concurrent task during navigation, with slower responses indicating that the main task is using more limited cognitive resources.",
